SUMMARY:[OOPSLA 26] R1 Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Extracted automatically by a small language model\; please cro
 ss-check against the source before relying on it: https://2026.splashcon.
 org/track/oopsla-2026\n\nPapers must be submitted via HotCRP at https://o
 opsla26.hotcrp.com/. Initial submissions must be at most 23 pages\; revis
 ions can go up to 25 pages. PACMPL(OOPSLA) uses double-blind reviewing wi
 th two rounds of review. At least one senior author must register as a re
 serve reviewer unless exempt. Papers accepted in either round will be pub
 lished in the 2026 volume of PACMPL and invited to present in-person at t
 he SPLASH conference in 2026\; remote presentations are not possible.\n\n
 Submit at: https://oopsla26.hotcrp.com/\n\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/
 pl-conferences
END:VEVENT
